								<div class="ms-ind-scene ms-scene-schools">
									<p class="ms-scene-title">Class 4B, this week</p>
									<div class="ms-school-grid">
										<span class="ms-school-head">Student</span><span class="ms-school-head">Mon</span><span class="ms-school-head">Tue</span><span class="ms-school-head">Wed</span><span class="ms-school-head">Thu</span><span class="ms-school-head">Fri</span><span class="ms-school-head">Result</span>
										<span class="ms-school-name">Student 01</span>
										<span class="ms-school-cell"><i class="ms-dot is-present ms-anim" style="--col:1"><span class="ms-ind-sr">Present</span></i></span>
										<span class="ms-school-cell"><i class="ms-dot is-present ms-anim" style="--col:2"><span class="ms-ind-sr">Present</span></i></span>
										<span class="ms-school-cell"><i class="ms-dot is-present ms-anim" style="--col:3"><span class="ms-ind-sr">Present</span></i></span>
										<span class="ms-school-cell"><i class="ms-dot is-present ms-anim" style="--col:4"><span class="ms-ind-sr">Present</span></i></span>
										<span class="ms-school-cell"><i class="ms-dot is-present ms-anim" style="--col:5"><span class="ms-ind-sr">Present</span></i></span>
										<span class="ms-school-cell"><i class="ms-result ms-anim" style="--delay:.5s">A</i></span>
										<span class="ms-school-name">Student 02</span>
										<span class="ms-school-cell"><i class="ms-dot is-present ms-anim" style="--col:1"><span class="ms-ind-sr">Present</span></i></span>
										<span class="ms-school-cell"><i class="ms-dot is-present ms-anim" style="--col:2"><span class="ms-ind-sr">Present</span></i></span>
										<span class="ms-school-cell"><i class="ms-dot is-absent ms-anim" style="--col:3"><span class="ms-ind-sr">Absent</span></i></span>
										<span class="ms-school-cell"><i class="ms-dot is-present ms-anim" style="--col:4"><span class="ms-ind-sr">Present</span></i></span>
										<span class="ms-school-cell"><i class="ms-dot is-present ms-anim" style="--col:5"><span class="ms-ind-sr">Present</span></i></span>
										<span class="ms-school-cell"><i class="ms-result ms-anim" style="--delay:.5s">B</i></span>
										<span class="ms-school-name">Student 03</span>
										<span class="ms-school-cell"><i class="ms-dot is-present ms-anim" style="--col:1"><span class="ms-ind-sr">Present</span></i></span>
										<span class="ms-school-cell"><i class="ms-dot is-present ms-anim" style="--col:2"><span class="ms-ind-sr">Present</span></i></span>
										<span class="ms-school-cell"><i class="ms-dot is-present ms-anim" style="--col:3"><span class="ms-ind-sr">Present</span></i></span>
										<span class="ms-school-cell"><i class="ms-dot is-present ms-anim" style="--col:4"><span class="ms-ind-sr">Present</span></i></span>
										<span class="ms-school-cell"><i class="ms-dot is-present ms-anim" style="--col:5"><span class="ms-ind-sr">Present</span></i></span>
										<span class="ms-school-cell"><i class="ms-result ms-anim" style="--delay:.5s">A</i></span>
										<span class="ms-school-name">Student 04</span>
										<span class="ms-school-cell"><i class="ms-dot is-present ms-anim" style="--col:1"><span class="ms-ind-sr">Present</span></i></span>
										<span class="ms-school-cell"><i class="ms-dot is-absent ms-anim" style="--col:2"><span class="ms-ind-sr">Absent</span></i></span>
										<span class="ms-school-cell"><i class="ms-dot is-present ms-anim" style="--col:3"><span class="ms-ind-sr">Present</span></i></span>
										<span class="ms-school-cell"><i class="ms-dot is-absent ms-anim" style="--col:4"><span class="ms-ind-sr">Absent</span></i></span>
										<span class="ms-school-cell"><i class="ms-dot is-present ms-anim" style="--col:5"><span class="ms-ind-sr">Present</span></i></span>
										<span class="ms-school-cell"><i class="ms-result ms-anim" style="--delay:.5s">C</i></span>
										<span class="ms-school-name">Student 05</span>
										<span class="ms-school-cell"><i class="ms-dot is-present ms-anim" style="--col:1"><span class="ms-ind-sr">Present</span></i></span>
										<span class="ms-school-cell"><i class="ms-dot is-present ms-anim" style="--col:2"><span class="ms-ind-sr">Present</span></i></span>
										<span class="ms-school-cell"><i class="ms-dot is-present ms-anim" style="--col:3"><span class="ms-ind-sr">Present</span></i></span>
										<span class="ms-school-cell"><i class="ms-dot is-present ms-anim" style="--col:4"><span class="ms-ind-sr">Present</span></i></span>
										<span class="ms-school-cell"><i class="ms-dot is-present ms-anim" style="--col:5"><span class="ms-ind-sr">Present</span></i></span>
										<span class="ms-school-cell"><i class="ms-result ms-anim" style="--delay:.5s">A</i></span>
									</div>
								</div>
								<p class="ms-ind-caption">Sample view</p>
							</div>
							<div class="ms-ind-list">
								<div class="ms-ind-item"><p class="ms-ind-item-label">Admissions</p><p class="ms-ind-item-text">New students enrolled once, with their details kept in one place.</p></div>
								<div class="ms-ind-item"><p class="ms-ind-item-label">Attendance</p><p class="ms-ind-item-text">Teachers mark each class in seconds, and absences are easy to see.</p></div>
								<div class="ms-ind-item"><p class="ms-ind-item-label">Results</p><p class="ms-ind-item-text">Scores gathered by subject and term, then signed off before they are published.</p></div>
								<div class="ms-ind-item"><p class="ms-ind-item-label">Report cards</p><p class="ms-ind-item-text">Clear report cards, ready to print or share once results are approved.</p></div>
							</div>
						</div>
					</article>

					<article class="ms-ind-panel" data-panel="clinics">
						<div class="ms-ind-top">
							<h3 class="ms-ind-title">Clinic system</h3>
							<span class="ms-ind-chip">A shape we build to</span>
						</div>
						<div class="ms-ind-body">
							<div class="ms-ind-figure">
								<div class="ms-ind-scene ms-scene-clinics">
									<div class="ms-clinic-head"><p class="ms-scene-title">Today's visits</p><span class="ms-clinic-count">4 visits</span></div>
									<div class="ms-clinic-timeline">
										<span class="ms-clinic-line ms-anim"></span>
										<div class="ms-clinic-row ms-anim" style="--delay:.08s"><span class="ms-clinic-time">09:00</span><i class="ms-clinic-node is-done"></i><span class="ms-clinic-ticket">Ticket 1</span><span class="ms-status">Done</span></div>
										<div class="ms-clinic-row ms-anim" style="--delay:.16s"><span class="ms-clinic-time">09:20</span><i class="ms-clinic-node is-active"></i><span class="ms-clinic-ticket">Ticket 2</span><span class="ms-status">In consultation</span></div>
										<div class="ms-clinic-row ms-anim" style="--delay:.24s"><span class="ms-clinic-time">09:40</span><i class="ms-clinic-node is-wait"></i><span class="ms-clinic-ticket">Ticket 3</span><span class="ms-status">Waiting</span></div>
										<div class="ms-clinic-row ms-anim" style="--delay:.32s"><span class="ms-clinic-time">10:00</span><i class="ms-clinic-node is-wait"></i><span class="ms-clinic-ticket">Ticket 4</span><span class="ms-status">Waiting</span></div>
									</div>
								</div>
								<p class="ms-ind-caption">Sample view</p>
							</div>
							<div class="ms-ind-list">
								<div class="ms-ind-item"><p class="ms-ind-item-label">Patients</p><p class="ms-ind-item-text">One file per patient, with every visit and note in order.</p></div>
								<div class="ms-ind-item"><p class="ms-ind-item-label">Queue</p><p class="ms-ind-item-text">Reception sees who is waiting, who is in consultation and who is done.</p></div>
								<div class="ms-ind-item"><p class="ms-ind-item-label">Stock</p><p class="ms-ind-item-text">Medicines and supplies counted, with a warning before they run out.</p></div>
								<div class="ms-ind-item"><p class="ms-ind-item-label">Referrals</p><p class="ms-ind-item-text">Referrals and supply requests checked by the right person before they go ahead.</p></div>
							</div>
						</div>
					</article>

					<article class="ms-ind-panel" data-panel="shops">
						<div class="ms-ind-top">
							<h3 class="ms-ind-title">Shop system</h3>
							<span class="ms-ind-chip">A shape we build to</span>
						</div>
						<div class="ms-ind-body">
							<div class="ms-ind-figure">
								<div class="ms-ind-scene ms-scene-shops">
									<p class="ms-scene-title">Shelf stock</p>
									<div class="ms-shop-grid">
										<div class="ms-shop-tile ms-anim" style="--delay:.08s"><span class="ms-shop-name">Rice</span><span class="ms-shop-track"><i class="ms-anim" style="--pct:84%; --delay:.08s"></i></span><span class="ms-shop-count">42 left</span></div>
										<div class="ms-shop-tile ms-anim" style="--delay:.16s"><span class="ms-shop-name">Beans</span><span class="ms-shop-track"><i class="ms-anim" style="--pct:36%; --delay:.16s"></i></span><span class="ms-shop-count">18 left</span></div>
										<div class="ms-shop-tile ms-anim" style="--delay:.24s"><span class="ms-shop-name">Oil</span><span class="ms-shop-track"><i class="ms-anim" style="--pct:12%; --delay:.24s"></i></span><span class="ms-shop-count">6 left</span><span class="ms-shop-low ms-anim" style="--delay:.44s">Low</span></div>
										<div class="ms-shop-tile ms-anim" style="--delay:.32s"><span class="ms-shop-name">Sugar</span><span class="ms-shop-track"><i class="ms-anim" style="--pct:62%; --delay:.32s"></i></span><span class="ms-shop-count">31 left</span></div>
									</div>
								</div>
								<p class="ms-ind-caption">Sample view</p>
							</div>
							<div class="ms-ind-list">
								<div class="ms-ind-item"><p class="ms-ind-item-label">Sales</p><p class="ms-ind-item-text">Every sale recorded at the till, by item and by cashier.</p></div>
								<div class="ms-ind-item"><p class="ms-ind-item-label">Stock</p><p class="ms-ind-item-text">Stock counts update with each sale, and low items are flagged early.</p></div>
								<div class="ms-ind-item"><p class="ms-ind-item-label">Cashiers</p><p class="ms-ind-item-text">Each cashier sees only their own tasks, and the owner sees everything.</p></div>
								<div class="ms-ind-item"><p class="ms-ind-item-label">Discounts</p><p class="ms-ind-item-text">Discounts and restocking checked by the owner before they apply.</p></div>
							</div>
						</div>
					</article>

					<article class="ms-ind-panel" data-panel="logistics">
						<div class="ms-ind-top">
							<h3 class="ms-ind-title">Logistics system</h3>
							<span class="ms-ind-chip">A shape we build to</span>
						</div>
						<div class="ms-ind-body">
							<div class="ms-ind-figure">
								<div class="ms-ind-scene ms-scene-logistics">
									<p class="ms-scene-title">Today's route</p>
									<div class="ms-route">
										<div class="ms-route-track">
											<span class="ms-route-line"></span>
											<span class="ms-route-fill ms-anim"></span>
											<span class="ms-van-wrap ms-anim"><i class="ms-van-dot"></i><span class="ms-van-chip">Van 1</span></span>
											<div class="ms-route-node ms-anim" style="--at:0%; --tx:0%; --delay:.08s"><i></i><span class="ms-route-name">Depot</span><span class="ms-route-status">Left 08:30</span></div>
											<div class="ms-route-node ms-anim" style="--at:33.3%; --tx:-50%; --delay:.16s"><i></i><span class="ms-route-name">Stop 1</span><span class="ms-route-status">Delivered</span></div>
											<div class="ms-route-node ms-anim" style="--at:66.7%; --tx:-50%; --delay:.24s"><i></i><span class="ms-route-name">Stop 2</span><span class="ms-route-status">Arrives 14:20</span></div>
											<div class="ms-route-node ms-anim" style="--at:100%; --tx:-100%; --delay:.32s"><i></i><span class="ms-route-name">Stop 3</span><span class="ms-route-status">Arrives 14:50</span></div>
										</div>
									</div>
								</div>
								<p class="ms-ind-caption">Sample view</p>
							</div>
							<div class="ms-ind-list">
								<div class="ms-ind-item"><p class="ms-ind-item-label">Orders</p><p class="ms-ind-item-text">Every order logged once, then followed to the door.</p></div>
								<div class="ms-ind-item"><p class="ms-ind-item-label">Fleet</p><p class="ms-ind-item-text">See which vehicle is where and what it is carrying.</p></div>
								<div class="ms-ind-item"><p class="ms-ind-item-label">Routes</p><p class="ms-ind-item-text">Plan stops in a sensible order and share the day's route with each driver.</p></div>
								<div class="ms-ind-item"><p class="ms-ind-item-label">Dispatch</p><p class="ms-ind-item-text">A route is signed off before the vehicle leaves.</p></div>
							</div>
						</div>
					</article>
				</div>
			</div>
